  "idea": "Stirling-PDF: 100 percent free open-source PDF power tool",
  "text": "This secret tool makes paid PDF software subscriptions completely obsolete. Agencies waste hundreds of dollars each month buying Acrobat seats just for basic page extraction and file compression. Commercial vendors trap your agency in annual contracts while providing slow bloatware that hogs system memory. Stirling-PDF bundles optical character recognition, metadata removal, and multi-page restructuring into a fast local browser interface. You strip out unnecessary software overhead and boost document speed.",
